bootstrap/cache/
.env
# Databases must come from the mounted data volume, never from the build
# context. These patterns are deliberately `**/` — a bare `*.sqlite` only
# matches the context root, so storage/app/database.sqlite was being baked into
# the image, shipping real data and masking a failed volume mount.
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal
# The Enable Banking signing key, same reasoning. A key baked into an image is
# a key published to every registry the image reaches and present in every
# layer cache that ever pulled it — and image layers are not revocable. It
# belongs in the mounted data directory; see docs/enable-banking-usage.md.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.git/
.phpunit.cache/
